                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  [Picture and Sound. You can change the settings for the picture and the sound according to your preference., Choosing a sound mode. Settings Sound Sound Mode Try Now You can select a favorite sound mode suitable for the content type or the listening environment. Standard Optimized Amplify This function may not be supported depending on the model., Configuring a Sound Mode and Expert Settings. Change the Sound Mode and adjust Expert Settings.]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            Based on the provided context, there is no mention of being able to select \"Sound Feedback\" as a specific option. The sound settings mentioned include selecting a sound mode suitable for content type or listening environment, such as Standard, Optimized, or Amplify. There is also mention of adjusting expert settings, but Sound Feedback is not explicitly noted as an option.    gpt-3.5-turbo-0125  gpt-4-turbo-2024-04-09  emanual_validation                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         