e update itself automatically while you are watching the TV.], [1c, When the background update is completed, it is applied the next time the TV is turned on.], [1d, If you agree to the Smart Hub terms and conditions, Auto Update is set to automatically.], [1e, If you want this function disabled, use the Select button to turn it off.], [1f, This function may take a longer time if another network function is running concurrently.], [1g, This function requires an Internet connection.]], [[2a, Updating the TV's software to the latest version.], [2b, DO NOT turn off the TV's power until the update is complete.], [2c, The TV will turn off and on automatically after completing the software update.], [2d, Video and audio settings will be reset to their defaults after a software update.], [2e, Updating through the Internet Settings Support Software Update Update Now Try Now Updating from the Internet requires an active Internet connection.], [2f, Updating through a USB device Settings Support Software Update Update Now After downloading the update file from the Samsung website and storing it on a USB device, connect the USB device to the TV to update.], [2g, To update using a USB flash drive, download the update package from Samsung.com to your computer.], [2h, Then, save the update package in the USB device's top-level folder.], [2i, Otherwise, the TV will not be able to locate the update package.]]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        [[a, To update the TV's software through the Internet, you need to go to Settings, then Support, then Software Update, and finally select Update Now or Try Now.], [b, This process requires an active Internet connection for the TV to download and apply the software update automatically.]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 